KeepPAM bundled runtime (on-prem)

This distribution ships third-party components as KeepPAM runtime
(not as separate vendor products the customer must license from us):

- PostgreSQL          → keeppam-db              (metadata)
- Redis               → keeppam-cache           (sessions / pubsub)
- Apache Guacamole guacd → keeppam-session-gateway (KeepPAM Session Gateway)
- Tesseract OCR via guacenc → keeppam-guacenc   (KeepPAM OCR)
- OpenSearch + Dashboards → keeppam-search / keeppam-search-ui (KeepPAM Search, optional)
- Prometheus, Grafana, Tempo, OpenTelemetry Collector (observability stand)
- HAProxy             → keeppam-edge            (HA edge, optional)
- NATS                → keeppam-nats            (optional SIEM transport)
- Alpine / curl       → keeppam-helper-alpine / keeppam-curl (ops helpers)

First-party images: keeppam-api (alias of deploy-api), keeppam-web,
keeppam-guacenc, keeppam-firewall-probe, keeppam-iso-browser, keeppam-demo-ssh.

Install/upgrade retags upstream names to keeppam-* and runs compose with
deploy/compose.branded.yml (KEEPPAM_BRAND=1). See docs/runtime-brand.txt,
docs/offline-update.txt, docs/kp.txt (T-03).
